{"images":[],"manifest":{"budgetTokens":15000,"countMethod":"proxy","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","packSha":"ac1b76f1aefe28a93d0a53cd9720bcaf181c3f86b44d3f50ef672706b702c91a","packTokens":2616,"recipeVersion":"1","redactions":0,"sections":[{"id":"tpl","tokens":67,"trimmed":false,"trust":"trusted"},{"id":"spans","tokens":281,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"answers","tokens":2,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"sentences","tokens":2196,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"task","tokens":8,"trimmed":false,"trust":"trusted"}],"stage":"round-trip"},"pointers":[],"system":"Map each restated sentence to the original intent spans (I-n) and answers (Q-n) it comes from. A sentence that matches none gets empty lists. Every sentence n must appear once.","tools":[],"user":"<artifact id=\"spans\" kind=\"intent\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-1\",\n  \"text\": \"Build a three-screen web portal for parts ordering (Find parts, Cart, My orders)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-2\",\n  \"text\": \"Display parts with search and filtering by category and brand\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-3\",\n  \"text\": \"Implement shopping cart with add/remove/quantity management\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-4\",\n  \"text\": \"Build checkout with delivery address and option selection\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-5\",\n  \"text\": \"Create order placement and order history tracking\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-6\",\n  \"text\": \"Support order cancellation and status timeline visualization\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-7\",\n  \"text\": \"Ensure WCAG 2.1 AA compliance and responsive design\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-8\",\n  \"text\": \"Deliver 2-second page load performance with 5,000 parts\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"answers\" kind=\"answers\" sha=\"\">\n[]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"sentences\" kind=\"restated\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"n\": 1,\n  \"text\": \"The portal shall provide exactly three screens for the signed-in buyer: Find parts at /parts, Cart and checkout at /cart, and My orders at /orders, with order details shown on the same /orders page.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 2,\n  \"text\": \"The parts API shall return parts sorted by name A-Z, 20 per page, each with image (or none), name, part number, brand, price in GBP with 2 decimals, stock state and whole-number stock quantity.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 3,\n  \"text\": \"The parts API shall set stock state to 'In stock' for 5 or more, 'Low stock (n left)' for 1 to 4, and 'Out of stock' for 0.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 4,\n  \"text\": \"The parts API shall filter by search text of at least 2 characters, matching name or part number case-insensitively.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 5,\n  \"text\": \"The parts API shall filter by a single chosen category and brand, combined with search text, where 'All' means no filter.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 6,\n  \"text\": \"The portal shall reset Find parts to page 1 whenever the search text or a filter changes.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 7,\n  \"text\": \"The portal shall show 'No parts match' with a clear button when no part matches the search and filters.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 8,\n  \"text\": \"The cart shall add a new line with quantity 1, or increase an existing line's quantity by 1, when 'Add to cart' is pressed on an in-stock part.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 9,\n  \"text\": \"The portal shall show in the header a cart count equal to the total quantity in the cart, updated whenever the cart changes.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 10,\n  \"text\": \"The portal shall disable the 'Add to cart' button for out-of-stock parts.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 11,\n  \"text\": \"The cart shall show each line's name, part number, unit price, quantity and line total (unit price times quantity).\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 12,\n  \"text\": \"The cart shall recalculate the line total and order totals immediately when a line quantity changes.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 13,\n  \"text\": \"The cart shall set a quantity that is blank, 0, above 99 or non-integer to the nearest whole number from 1 to 99.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 14,\n  \"text\": \"The cart shall cap a quantity above a part's stock to the stock quantity and show 'Only n available'.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 15,\n  \"text\": \"The cart shall remove a line when 'Remove' is pressed on it.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 16,\n  \"text\": \"The cart shall persist its lines in local storage under the signed-in buyer's ID so it survives page reloads on the same device.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 17,\n  \"text\": \"The portal shall show 'Your cart is empty' with a link to Find parts and hide checkout while the cart is empty.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 18,\n  \"text\": \"The checkout shall enable 'Place order' only when the address has 5 to 200 characters and a delivery option is selected.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 19,\n  \"text\": \"The checkout shall show subtotal, delivery charge (Standard £0.00, Next day £9.99) and total as subtotal plus delivery charge.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 20,\n  \"text\": \"The orders API shall save a placed order with status Placed, a sequential order number ORD-000001 style, each line's current part price as unit price, and total as subtotal plus delivery charge.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 21,\n  \"text\": \"The orders API shall reject with status 400 and save no order when lines are missing, quantity is outside 1-99, part number is unknown, address length is invalid, or delivery option is missing or unknown.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 22,\n  \"text\": \"The orders API shall reject with status 409 and save no order when any line's quantity exceeds available stock, returning the affected part numbers and available stock.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 23,\n  \"text\": \"The portal shall empty the cart and show the new order number when an order is placed successfully.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 24,\n  \"text\": \"The portal shall show an error message and retain cart lines, address and delivery option if placing an order fails due to a network or server error.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 25,\n  \"text\": \"The orders API shall leave parts stock quantity unchanged when an order is placed or cancelled.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 26,\n  \"text\": \"The API shall reject requests with status 401 when there is no valid session token or cookie.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 27,\n  \"text\": \"The orders API shall return to a buyer only that buyer's own orders.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 28,\n  \"text\": \"The orders API shall return a buyer's orders newest first, each with order number, date placed, item count, total and status.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 29,\n  \"text\": \"The orders API shall filter a buyer's orders by status when a status filter is chosen.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 30,\n  \"text\": \"The orders API shall return an order's lines, delivery address, delivery option, total and status when opened.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 31,\n  \"text\": \"The portal shall show a status timeline Placed to Packed to Dispatched to Delivered with the current status marked by text as well as colour.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 32,\n  \"text\": \"The portal shall show a 'Cancel order' button with confirmation while an order's status is Placed.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 33,\n  \"text\": \"The orders API shall set an order's status to Cancelled when cancelled while still Placed.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 34,\n  \"text\": \"The orders API shall reject cancellation with status 409 and leave status unchanged if the order is no longer Placed.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 35,\n  \"text\": \"The portal shall show 'No orders yet' with a link to Find parts while the buyer has no orders.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 36,\n  \"text\": \"The portal shall display all three screens without horizontal scrolling at viewport widths from 360px upward.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 37,\n  \"text\": \"The portal shall give every form field a visible label and support full keyboard operability.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 38,\n  \"text\": \"The Find parts screen shall load its first page of results in under 2 seconds with 5,000 parts in the database.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 39,\n  \"text\": \"The cart shall adjust to a 409 stock conflict response by lowering affected lines to available stock with a message, removing lines with zero available stock with a message, and keeping other lines unchanged.\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\nMap the sentences."}